NOTE ON SOURCE DATA

This licence covers the software only. Data processed by this pipeline carries
its own terms:

- UK Companies House products (company snapshot, PSC snapshot) are published
  under the Open Government Licence v3.0.
  https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

- The OpenSanctions default dataset is published under CC-BY-NC 4.0.
  Commercial use requires a licence from OpenSanctions.
  https://www.opensanctions.org/licensing/

Neither dataset is redistributed in this repository. The committed fixture
corpus is entirely synthetic and contains no real persons or companies.
